<title>USA: U.S. weekly national grain stocks by region - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. weekly national grain stocks by region - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>National stocks of grain, in thousand bushels, as reported by the USDA.</p>
<p>		   Wheat   Corn  Soybeans Pct filled</p>
<p> Atlantic cst    1625    550    1361    35</p>
<p> Great Lakes    29522   3691   12960    26</p>
<p> River Points   16923  11594   23579    31</p>
<p> Southwest	16189   8645     569    19</p>
<p> Gulf Points    14842   4882    6176    31</p>
<p> Plains Area    35253  15455    3272    27</p>
<p> Pacific NW     11350   1537     unq    41</p>
<p> Grand Total   125704  46354   47647    28</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-983-7278--</p>
